<div class="relative">
    <section class="layer sticky top-0 z-10 bg-bg-primary max-w-295 mx-auto px-7 pt-12 pb-10 opacity-0 translate-y-4 transition-[opacity,transform] duration-600 ease-out [&.in-view]:opacity-100 [&.in-view]:translate-y-0" id="contact" data-layer-name="Contacto">
        <div class="eyebrow font-mono text-[12.5px] text-accent tracking-[0.08em] uppercase flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-3 before:content-[''] before:w-6 before:h-0.5 before:bg-linear-to-r before:from-accent before:to-secondary before:rounded-sm">06 — contacto</div>
        <h2 class="section-title text-[1.7rem] sm:text-[2.1rem] font-bold mb-2 font-display">Hablemos</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle text-text-muted mb-8 text-[1.05rem]">¿Tenés un proyecto en mente?</p>

        <div class="bg-bg-card border border-border rounded-card px-8 py-10 sm:px-10 sm:py-12 text-center mb-8 shadow-card bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_0%,var(--color-accent-dim),transparent_60%)]">
            <h3 class="font-display text-[1.9rem] font-bold mb-2.5">Contáctame</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary max-w-[46ch] mx-auto mb-7">Estoy abierto a nuevos proyectos, colaboraciones y roles remotos.</p>
            <a
                href="mailto:zepta2249@gmail.com"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[13.5px] px-6 py-3.5 rounded-lg bg-linear-to-br from-accent to-secondary text-bg-primary font-bold shadow-[0_4px_14px_var(--color-accent-glow)] transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_8px_25px_var(--color-accent-glow)]"
            >
                <i class="fas fa-paper-plane"></i> Escribeme
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="max-w-[46ch]">
            <p class="text-text-secondary mb-6">También podés encontrarme en GitHub y LinkedIn.</p>
            <div class="flex gap-5 text-2xl">
                <a href="https://github.com/MiloZ-Dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="GitHub" class="inline-block text-text-muted transition-all duration-200 hover:text-accent hover:scale-110 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
                    <i class="fab fa-github"></i>
                </a>
                <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/miloz-dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="LinkedIn" class="inline-block text-text-muted transition-all duration-200 hover:text-accent hover:scale-110 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
                    <i class="fab fa-linkedin-in"></i>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="h-[35vh]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</div>